        },
        "quote": "The duties of the Floodplain Administrator shall include, but not be limited to:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.140 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "4777572f-3245-593f-8bee-8952ccee0fe9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 294,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:1",
          "start": 81
        },
        "quote": "(a) Review of all applications for floodplain development permits to assure that sites are reasonably safe from flooding and that the floodplain development permit requirements of this chapter have been satisfied;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.140 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "24f1b978-a29c-5b91-8fff-57d7a2b442d6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 564,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:2",
          "start": 295
        },
        "quote": "(b) Review of all applications for floodplain development permits for proposed development to assure that all necessary permits have been obtained from Federal, State, or local governmental agencies from which prior approval is required by Federal, State, or local law;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.140 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "ad29f12c-9295-50ef-800d-27888d802179",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 763,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:3",
          "start": 565
        },
        "quote": "(c) Review all subdivision proposals and other proposed new development, including manufactured home parks or subdivisions, to determine whether such proposals will be reasonably safe from flooding;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.140 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "0e2b6bc7-581c-519f-acac-3eb1911d2959",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 835,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:4",
          "start": 764
        },
        "quote": "(d) Issue floodplain development permits for all approved applications;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.140 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "9e9494b9-7581-5353-8a89-ce986871dab1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1086,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:5",
          "start": 836
        },
        "quote": "(e) Notify adjacent communities and the Division of Water Resources, Kansas Department of Agriculture, prior to any alteration or relocation of a watercourse, and submit evidence of such notification to the Federal Emergency Management Agency (FEMA);",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.140 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "20574fad-f4ad-5d92-9e51-8ff02d1590c4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1232,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:6",
          "start": 1087
        },
        "quote": "(f) Assure that the flood-carrying capacity is not diminished and shall be maintained within the altered or relocated portion of any watercourse;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.140 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "00adfe52-999b-540b-b832-da1bcb367047",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1411,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:7",
          "start": 1233
        },
        "quote": "(g) Verify and maintain a record of the actual elevation (in relation to mean sea level) of the lowest floor, including basement, of all new or substantially improved structures;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.140 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "50a7e712-0813-51d9-a666-6e9324652d2f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1593,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:8",
          "start": 1412
        },
        "quote": "(h) Verify and maintain a record of the actual elevation (in relation to mean sea level) that the new or substantially improved nonresidential structures have been floodproofed; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.140:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.140 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "2aacd895-5e72-58a1-8ab0-f75571f19f69",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
